''Modding''' Rebirth & Afterbirth is limited to editing and replacing existing assets unless you [https://antibirth.com/ hack the .exe yourself].

== Installing Mods ==
Mods made for Rebirth & Afterbirth must be installed manually into the game's resources folder.

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! OS !! Path
|-
| Windows || <code>Steam/steamapps/common/The Binding of Isaac Rebirth/resources</code>
|-
|Mac
|Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/The Binding of Isaac Rebirth/The Binding of Isaac Rebirth.app/Contents/Resources/resources
|}

To properly install mods for this version of the game, you must place what is inside of the mod's resource folder into the resources folder at the file path above.

== Limitations ==
Modding for this version of the game is limited to replacing existing files. Custom code (such as LUA code) cannot be executed, making most custom logic impossible. However, some mods have made attempts to work around this limitation by abusing certain default game logic - such as adding additional events to a monster's animation file. This could result in, for example, an enemy firing two projectiles instead of one.

