== Mod Hosts ==
* [https://www.moddingofisaac.com/ The Modding of Isaac]
A service by the community to host mods created primarily for Rebirth and Afterbirth.
* [http://www.nexusmods.com/thebindingofisaacrebirth/ The Binding of Isaac Rebirth NexusMods]
A section of NexusMods that is home to some Isaac mods. Not very active.
* [https://antibirth.com/ The Binding of Isaac: Antibirth (Official Site)]
A website that features the main source of downloads for the Binding of Isaac: Antibirth mod (many contents of which were implemented into [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]] but some of which are only available in the unofficial mod). This mod only works if all DLCs for the Binding of Isaac: Rebirth are disabled.

